<title>PHILIPPINES: TABLE-Philippine T-bills secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Philippine T-bills secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Thursday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	 6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America     14.00 /13.5    15.00 /14.00   15.25/14.25</p>
<p>Citibank		14.00 /13.25   14.50 /14.00   15.00/14.50</p>
<p>HongKong Bank	 14.25 /13.5    14.875/14.00   15.25/14.50</p>
<p>Multinational	 14.00 /13.0    15.00 /13.50   16.00/14.25</p>
<p>StanChart	     14.00 /13.75   14.50 /14.00   15.00/14.50</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>* To contribute to this page, please fax your quotes to Reuters Manila newsroom on (632) 817 6267. For details, please phone (632) 841 8937</p>
